OL,3,GNEWSAA royal romance that captured
OL,4,Aheadlines a century ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FA little-known royal romance that made
OL,7,Fheadlines more than 100 years ago is
OL,8,Fbeing retold as part of Diwali
OL,9,Fcelebrations later this month.
OL,11,FPrincess Sudhira of Cooch Behar, in
OL,12,Fpresent-day West Bengal, fell in love
OL,13,Fwith Alan Mander after the pair met in
OL,14,Fa London nursing home in the early
OL,15,F1900s.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
