OL,3,GNEWSAA royal romance that captured
OL,4,Aheadlines a century ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir story, which included family
OL,7,Fopposition, an extended voyage intended
OL,8,Fto keep them apart and a suitor who
OL,9,Freportedly followed his future bride
OL,10,Faround the world, forms part of
OL,11,Fcelebrations at the National Trust's
OL,12,FWightwick Manor and Gardens in
OL,13,FWolverhampton, from 24 October until 8
OL,14,FNovember.
OL,16,FKnown as the Festival of Lights, Diwali
OL,17,Fis celebrated by Hindus, Sikhs and
OL,18,FJains, as well as some Buddhists around
OL,19,Fthe world.
